      <string id="AboutDialog_Explain">Enable this option to set the new contents in 'About Foxit PDF Editor' dialog.

Copyright: Change the content of copyright. The default is Foxit information.

Copyright Content: Change the contents under copyright information. The default lists the technology built in Foxit PDF Editor.

BackGroundPath: Set the path of the background.</string>

      <string id="CPDF_AutoConvertConnectedPDF">Disable "Automatically save PDF files in ConnectedPDF format (including those created from plugins) only when signed in"</string>
      <string id="CPDF_AutoConvertConnectedPDF_Explain">Enabled this option to forbid the application from automatically saving PDF files in ConnectedPDF format.
	  
Note: ConnectedPDF features are only available in the Simplified Chinese versions. In other versions, this setting has no effect.</string>
      <string id="CPDF_DISABLE">Enable this setting to disable all ConnectedPDF features.

Note: ConnectedPDF features are only available in the Simplified Chinese versions. In other versions, this setting has no effect.</string>
      <string id="CPDF_disableConnectedPDF">Disable ConnectedPDF features</string>
      <string id="CPDF_OfficeAutoConvertConnectedPDF">Disable "Automatically convert Office files to Connected when converting to PDF via Office add-in"</string>
      <string id="CPDF_OfficeAutoConvertConnectedPDF_Explain">Enabled this option to forbid the application from automatically converting Office files to ConnectedPDF format when converting to PDF files.
	  
Note: ConnectedPDF features are only available in the Simplified Chinese versions. In other versions, this setting has no effect.</string>
      <string id="CPDF_PREFERENCES_Explain">Settings for ConnectedPDF features.</string>
      <string id="DisablePlugins_Explain">Enable this option to remove selected plugins.</string>
      <string id="DisablePluginsList_Explain">Enable this option and input the plugin name which needs to be removed.

Only applications with .fpi extensions can be removed from Foxit PDF Editor. You can find the plugins in the program folder of Foxit PDF Editor (..\Foxit PDF Editor\plugins).</string>
      <string id="MainFrameName_Explain">Enable this option to change the program's name. The default is 'Foxit PDF Editor'.</string>
