      <string id="PREF_DefaultPDFViewer">Default PDF Viewer</string>
      <string id="PREF_DefaultPDFViewer_Explain">This setting allows you to set PDF Editor as your default PDF viewer. It will take effect under the administrator account.

- System PDF Viewer: Check it to set PDF Editor as the system default PDF viewer.

- Web Browser PDF Viewer: Check it to include browser when setting Foxit PDF Editor as the default PDF viewer.

- Preview PDF Viewer: Check it to include preview when setting Foxit PDF Editor as the default PDF viewer.

- Thumbnail PDF Viewer: Check it to include thumbnail when setting Foxit PDF Editor as the default PDF viewer.

- Embedded Microsoft Office Documents PDF Viewer: Check it to use Foxit PDF Editor to open embedded Acrobat files and embedded Foxit PDF Reader PDF files in Microsoft Office if Acrobat and Foxit PDF Reader are not installed.</string>
