      <string id="AIP_FoxitAccount">Enable Microsoft Sensitivity Labeling Account to sync with Foxit Account</string>
      <string id="AIP_Account_Explain">This setting controls the synchronization of the Microsoft Sensitivity Labeling feature with Foxit application by unifying login information.

Enabled: the Microsoft Sensitivity Labeling feature will automatically log in using the same account, and its login status will be synchronized with it thereafter.

Disabled: the Microsoft Sensitivity Labeling feature will not automatically log in using the same account, and the two login sessions will not be synchronized.

NOTE: This setting applies to both Foxit PDF Editor and Reader.</string>
      <string id="AIP_SaveDoc_Explain">This setting controls the availability of Default Sensitivity Label and Mandatory Sensitivity Labeling feature in Foxit PDF Editor or Reader.

Enabled: Enable Default Sensitivity Label and Mandatory Sensitivity Labeling feature.

Disabled: Disable Default Sensitivity Label and Mandatory Sensitivity Labeling feature</string>
