      <string id="SUPPORTED_WINXPSP2">Microsoft Windows 7 or later</string>
      <string id="SUPPRESS_DLG">Forbid checking of default PDF viewer</string>
      <string id="SUPPRESS_DLG_EXPLAIN">This setting specifies whether to hide the "Set to Default PDF Reader" dialog on application startup when PDF Editor isn't the default PDF viewer.

Choose "Enabled" to forbid checking of default PDF viewer.

Choose "Disabled" to allow performing a check on application startup.

Note: When enabled, the corresponding option "Always perform check when starting Foxit PDF Editor" in Preferences and in the "Set to Default PDF Reader" dialog will be checked and locked down.</string>
