        <string id="PREF_SendCrashReport">Enable crash report dialogs</string>
	<string id="PREF_SendCrashDocument">Share the PDF file that caused crash</string>
 	<string id="PREF_SendCrashDocument_Explain">These settings control the crash report behavior. Here's how it works:

For 'Enable crash report dialogs':

    When enabled,  the crash report will appear.
    When disabled, no dialog will appear after a crash

For 'Share the PDF file that caused this crash' (only available in the crash report dialog):

    If checked, the PDF file that caused the crash will always be shared.

This will change and grey out the corresponding setting of 'Share the PDF file that caused this crash' option in Crash Report.

NOTE: These settings apply to both Foxit PDF Editor and Foxit PDF Reader.</string>
