	 <string id="PREF_AutoUpdateCert">Load trusted certificates from Foxit server</string>	  
	 <string id="PREF_AutoUpdateCert_Explain">This setting specifies the way to load "trusted certificates from Foxit server".

If this setting is enabled, three options will be available:
  "Disable": Don't load trusted certificates from Foxit server.
  "Enable &amp; Ask before updating": Load trusted certificates from Foxit server but will ask before updating.
  "Enable &amp; Install silently": Load trusted certificates from Foxit server but will install silently.

This will change the setting in Preferences > Trust Manager >Automatic Foxit Approved Trust List Updates.

If this setting is disabled or not configured, the default will take effect.</string>
     <string id="PREF_PDFAModeNever">Never</string>
	 <string id="PREF_PDFAModeOnly">Only for PDF/A documents</string>
	 <string id="PREF_AutoUpdateCertDisable">Disable</string>
