	 <string id="PREF_PDFAModeOpt">Settings:</string>
	 <string id="ECMServeriManage9">Configure iManage9 server URL</string>
	 <string id="ECMServeriManage9List">iManage9 Server URL:</string>	 
   	 <string id="ECMServeriManage9_Explain">This option allows you to configure a server URL for iManage 9. Any changes made here will be synchronized to the corresponding settings under File>Open or Save As> Add a place>iManage 9.

If this option is enabled, the URLs you add will appear in the login interface. The first URL added will be the default one.

If this option is disabled or not configured, the default will take effect.</string>
	 <string id="ECMServeriManage10">Configure iManage10 server URL</string>
	 <string id="ECMServeriManage10List">iManage10 Server URL:</string>	 
   	 <string id="ECMServeriManage10_Explain">This option allows you to configure a server URL for iManage 10. Any changes made here will be synchronized to the corresponding settings under File>Open or Save As> Add a place>iManage 10.

If this option is enabled, the URLs you add will appear in the login interface. The first URL added will be the default one.

If this option is disabled or not configured, the default will take effect.</string>
	 <string id="ECMServerSharePoint">Configure SharePoint server URL</string>
	 <string id="ECMServerSharePointList">SharePoint Server URL:</string>	 
   	 <string id="ECMServerSharePoint_Explain">This option allows you to configure a server URL for SharePoint. Any changes made here will be synchronized to the corresponding settings under File>Open or Save As> Add a place>SharePoint.

If this option is enabled, the URLs you add will appear in the login interface but only the recent 10 ones. The first URL added will be the default one.

If this option is disabled or not configured, the default will take effect.</string>
	 <string id="ECMServerAlfresco">Configure Alfresco server URL</string>
	 <string id="ECMServerAlfresco_Explain">This option allows you to configure a server URL for Alfresco. Any changes made here will be synchronized to the corresponding settings under File>Open or Save As> Add a place>Alfresco.

If this option is enabled, the URL you add will appear in the login interface.

If this option is disabled or not configured, the default will take effect.</string>
	 <string id="ECMServerAlfrescoLabel">Alfresco Server URL:</string>
	 <string id="PREF_CreatorPortRange">Configure communication port range for Foxit creator</string>
	 <string id="PREF_CreatorPortRange_Explain">This setting is used for configuring the communication port range for Foxit creator.
	 
If enabled, the maximum and minimum values you typed will take effect. The valid port range is "1024-65535".

Note: we recommend setting an appropriate port range based on the number of clients in an environment. For a single client, the maximum and minimum value difference should be no less than 10 to ensure that creator related functions could run smoothly.

If disabled or not configured, the default value "50000 - 60000" will take effect.
</string>
	<string id="PREF_CreatorPortRange_Label">Port Range:</string>
	<string id="PREF_CreatorPortRange_LabelMin">Min:</string>
    <string id="PREF_CreatorPortRange_LabelMax">Max:</string>
